          "id": "c",
          "text": "$70\\text{ cm}^2$"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$70\\sqrt{2}\\text{ cm}^2$"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "Area $= \\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 14 \\times \\sin 45° = 70 \\times \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} = 35\\sqrt{2}\\text{ cm}^2$."
